Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: ruling 11 core half: a Board-granted
 rollback hub review claim is still refused by the root CPU gate (test); docs:
 post-rollback hub review behaviour and the all-host turn wait; fix stale
 BUSY_WAIT_S docstring

